{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey of exploring different worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stones, wood, and make tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords, hammers, axes, and even floating cannons are all your specialties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075300/extras/dfc10e2bb6e9529711a4067dd76c036c.avif?t=1759980146\" width=366 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, people always have to eat. People are iron, rice is steel, and even in other worlds, there are many delicious foods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese, pork belly, chicken legs, meat soup, oranges, bananas, bread, watermelons, apples, distributed in small towns and wilderness, it's really a blessing for foodies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075300/extras/d1aaa0dbd8a3d160cd6363e5e4dba808.avif?t=1759980146\" data-has-big width=1560 height=492 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting is also essential for survival in the wild</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolf, deer, pig, fox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075300/extras/22f2a943c9910d2dd74498c4c350fbf7.avif?t=1759980146\" width=1442 height=1370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We can't always wander in the wilderness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building your own house is a good choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075300/extras/99c2527bd22cfa0613c156e5bd113736.avif?t=1759980146\" width=1560 height=1412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, even flat spaces are not as safe .....</p><p class=